  "source": "## Semantics: U1 (rs#297) — the quoted-string idiom over multibyte text:\n## the negated-class run advances by whole codepoints.\ngrammar ConformanceUnicodeQuoted version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## A quoted string whose body is any codepoints except quote/backslash.\n  quoted = \"\\\"\" *( !(\"\\\"\" / \"\\\\\") ANY ) \"\\\"\"\n\n  entry main: quoted\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"\\\"日本語 中文\\\"\"\n    accept \"\\\"emoji 🎉🚀 here\\\"\"\n    accept \"\\\"ascii too\\\"\"\n    reject \"\\\"unterminated\"\n    reject \"\\\"mixed ☃\\\" trailing\"\n  }\n}\n",
